WEBVTT

00:26:30.829 --> 00:26:32.829
I kind of want to say I'm sorry,
but I'm sorry.

00:26:33.121 --> 00:26:38.371
It's so it's so it's so deep and so
big that it layered the answers.

00:26:38.371 --> 00:26:42.204
Why do we hurt ourselves when we're
suffering? Why do we self-destruct when.

00:26:42.663 --> 00:26:48.579
Yeah, when we feel like we've been ruined
? I think it's a couple of things.

00:26:48.621 --> 00:26:52.079
I think one of the things
is it's a signal.

00:26:52.246 --> 00:26:57.454
It's a signal to the people around
us that we're saying help me.

00:26:57.579 --> 00:27:02.121
Even if we with our words are saying like,
oh, no, I'm fine, just leave me alone.